WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.435
[school bell rings]

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.770
[indistinct chatter]

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.838
OKAY, STUDENTS, SETTLE DOWN.

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:07.640
SETTLE DOWN.

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:09.675
THAT INCLUDES YOU,
MR. RODRIGUEZ.

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:13.479
DO YOU WANT TO TAKE THE MILK
CARTON OFF OF YOUR HEAD?

00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:15.248
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:18.084
WE HAVE A SPECIAL GUEST TODAY.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.453
HE'S FROM THIS NEIGHBORHOOD,

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:23.256
AND HE'S A FORMER GANG MEMBER,

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:26.392
AND HE'S COMING HERE
THIS MORNING TO TALK TO YOU

00:00:26.425 --> 00:00:28.428
ABOUT LIFE CHOICES.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.464
SO, PLEASE, GIVE A WARM
CENTRAL HIGH SCHOOL WELCOME

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:33.699
TO DONNIE HERRERA.

00:00:33.732 --> 00:00:36.669
[applause]

00:00:45.377 --> 00:00:46.946
- I USED TO BE JUST LIKE YOU...

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:49.949
[melancholy piano music]

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:52.618
JUST LIKE YOU, YOU, YOU, YOU.

00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:56.022
USED TO CLOWN AROUND...

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:59.158
MAKE FUN OF THE PRINCIPAL...

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:00.960
PUT MILK ON MY HEAD,

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:04.931
JUST LIKE YOU, RODRIGUEZ.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:07.633
AND THEN...

00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:11.471
I GOT HIT WITH AIDS.

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.507
CONSEQUENCES.

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:19.445
GOT INTO SOME
REAL TROUBLE, BOY.

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:22.315
STOLE FROM MY MOM AND DAD...

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.784
STOLE FROM MY OWN SISTER!

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:27.954
AND THEN ONE DAY...

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.555
A PIANO FELL ON MY HEAD.

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:33.693
- WHAT?
- CONSEQUENCES.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.394
- I FEEL LIKE
HE MISSED A STEP THERE.

00:01:35.427 --> 00:01:37.163
- GAVE ME 88 CONCUSSIONS,

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:39.031
ONE FOR EACH KEY.

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:42.301
YOU'D THINK I'M LEARNING,
BUT, NO.

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:43.936
SEE, I'M JUST LIKE YOU.

00:01:43.969 --> 00:01:45.471
I GOT BACK OUT THERE,

00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:49.942
STARTED MAKING
SOME REAL CRIMES, HOMEBOY.

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.644
OH, YEAH.

00:01:51.677 --> 00:01:53.513 line:92%
OH, YEAH.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:56.616
AND THEN...

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.417
I GOT TRAMPLED
BY A HERD OF BUFFALO.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:01.621
- WHAT?
- CONSEQUENCES.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.956
- OKAY, DONNIE,
I THINK WE'VE HAD ENOUGH.

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.392
- NOT DONE WITH MY STORY!

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:10.062
I WAS LIKE YOU!

00:02:10.095 --> 00:02:12.465
I DECIDED IT'D BE COOL

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:15.301
TO HANG OUT
WITH SOME OF THE TOUGH KIDS.

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:17.703
MM. YOU KNOW
WHO I'M TALKING ABOUT.

00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:21.941
THEY WERE HANGING
ON THE STREETS LATE AT NIGHT.

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:25.711
MORE THAN
CIGARETTE SMOKERS, HOMES.

00:02:25.744 --> 00:02:28.147
AND THEN...

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.617
ONE DAY I GOT SHOT
OUT OF A CATAPULT.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.319
- THAT'S IT.
OKAY.

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:34.921
- INTO THE MOUTH OF A DRAGON!

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:36.989
- STUDENTS, EVERYTHING YOU'VE
HEARD HERE TODAY IS A LIE.

00:02:37.022 --> 00:02:38.257
- I DON'T LIE ANYMORE.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.559
- YOU'RE ALL EXCUSED.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:44.497
- LOOK AT ME!
- PLEASE, I APOLOGIZE.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.432
- I SHOULDN'T EVEN BE HERE!

00:02:46.465 --> 00:02:48.167
- THANK YOU, AURELIO.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.335
I APOLOGIZE, DENISE.

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:50.970
- SO I GOT REALLY DEEP
INTO CRIME.

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:54.707
I DID A DRIVE-BY AT MY OWN
DAUGHTER'S<i> QUINCEAÑERA!</i>

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:58.411
YEAH, SHOT UP EVERYBODY--
DEAD, KILLED!

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:00.279
YEAH!

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:02.014 line:92%
YEAH!

00:03:02.047 --> 00:03:03.683
THEN I GOT SUCKED
INTO A WORMHOLE.

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:04.917
CONSEQUENCES.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.786
- THAT'S IT. OKAY.
EVERYBODY GO.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.588
- I WAS IN ANOTHER DIMENSION,

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.756
TRIED TO INTRODUCE
MY OWN PARENTS TO EACH OTHER.

00:03:10.789 --> 00:03:13.025
ALMOST FAILED.
ARM WAS DISAPPEARING.

00:03:13.058 --> 00:03:14.560
- I'VE HAD IT.

00:03:14.593 --> 00:03:16.395
- I INVENTED<i> JOHNNY B. GOODE</i> 
AT MY PARENTS' PROM,

00:03:16.428 --> 00:03:19.031
AND AT THE LAST MOMENT,
THEY KISSED, AND IT CAME BACK.

00:03:19.064 --> 00:03:20.933
- THE FASTER WE GET AWAY
FROM HIM, THE BETTER.

00:03:20.966 --> 00:03:22.835
- BUT NOBODY BELIEVE ME!

00:03:22.868 --> 00:03:25.238
WHERE'S MY CRACK?
WHERE'S MY CRACK?

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:27.306
OH.

00:03:27.339 --> 00:03:29.976
[booming crash]

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:31.177
OH!

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:32.210
CONSEQUENCES!

